      "guard": "body-in-travel",
      "clearance": 0.01,
      "note": "The Cube mast's head (r 0.260, groove r 0.195 at 0.070-0.110 over the crown top, cap to 0.160) rides the car's crown above the clamp level; below it the Cube's ceiling iris holds the head and the crown feeds the spiral-band column (r 0.170) out between them: the head rises relative to the car by (clamp - z). The column is Motion's variable-length piece (crown top to head), never modelled by hand at one length."
    },
